{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2022-12-06 03:00:00', 'title': 'EQUINIX TO "ADJUST THE THERMOSTAT" TO OPTIMIZE DATA CENTER ENERGY USE', 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF. , DEC. 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EQUINIX, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: EQIX), THE WORLD'S DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY™, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS COMMITMENT TO REDUCING ITS OVERALL POWER USE BY INCREASING OPERATING TEMPERATURE RANGES WITHIN ITS DATA CENTERS – THE FIRST SUCH COMMITMENT BY AN OPERATOR OF COLOCATION DATA CENTERS."}